\13\
Monsters can only have their [MonsterRarity|Rarity] upgraded once, and can not be upgraded beyond Rare.",
		["name"] = "Dreamer's Sight",
	},
	["BreachHiveSacrificeForPowerSkill"] = {
		["description"] = "A skill created by Ailith that sacrifices half her life to grant players 1000% more Damage and immunity to Damage for 10 seconds.",
		["name"] = "Dreamer's Might",
	},
	["BreachHiveSacrificeForRaritySkill"] = {
		["description"] = "A skill created by Ailith that sacrifices half her life to grant players 100% increased [ItemRarity|Item Rarity] in Breach Hives.",
