	["ExceedChance"] = {
		["description"] = "By default, chance-based stats cap at 100% chance for the result to occur. However, some chances can exceed 100%. Unless otherwise specified, a chance higher than 100% is equivalent to 100% chance - the chance always succeeds. But some effects may scale based on how high the chance is or how much it exceeds 100% by.",
